{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2022-05-03 07:13:00', 'title': 'GARMIN INTRODUCES ECHOMAP UHD2 CHARTPLOTTER SERIES WITH BRAND-NEW HARDWARE AND MODERN FEATURES', 'text': "OLATHE, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GARMIN® INTERNATIONAL, INC., A UNIT OF GARMIN LTD. (NYSE: GRMN), THE WORLD'S LARGEST1 AND MOST INNOVATIVE MARINE ELECTRONICS MANUFACTURER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ECHOMAP™ UHD2 CHARTPLOTTER SERIES WITH 500W OF VIVID, HIGH-CONTRAST SCANNING SONAR POWER, ALL-NEW HARDWARE WITH A SUNLIGHT READABLE DISPLAY AND MORE. OFFERED IN A NEW 5-INCH AS WELL AS THE POPULAR 7-INCH DISPLAY, THE ECHOMAP UHD2 PLOTTERS OFFER PHYSICAL BUTTONS FOR EASY CONTROL AND OPERATION OF FUNCTIONS EVE"}